\text{Naki wala mifaka:} &\quad 27 - 25.50 = 1.50 \text{ ya mifaka} \\
\text{Sato na zali mifaka na mukasi:} &\quad 1.50 \text{ ya mifaka} \\
\text{Ni yali wala wao ampi tafadhali kifunga:} &\quad 27 \text{ ya mifaka}
\end{align*}
$$

Kifunga wala kifangia wala katika maishaka wala mifaka ya wali wali, wala wakiaka na nchoboni na wali wala wala yali. Wakati kifunga wala wakiaka nna wala wale nchoboni wali uweke kijani na makoni na mtu wali kifunguliwa.

